                    </span>
                </h2>
                <p class="solution-text" data-i18n="solution.text">Recomendamos especialmente para quem não possui uma equipe muito grande para cuidar de todas as demandas ou o tempo necessário para gerenciar as diversas tarefas de uma loja virtual. Se você busca maior praticidade para seu time, um design exclusivo e a facilidade na gestão das vendas do seu e-commerce, a Shopify é uma ótima solução.</p>
                <a href="https://wa.me/5531995270548?text=Ol%C3%A1%21%20Gostaria%20de%20fazer%20um%20or%C3%A7amento%20para%20um%20site%20Shopify%20com%20a%20Flamma%20Digital." class="solution-link" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">
                    <span data-i18n="solution.cta">Quero criar uma loja na Shopify</span>
                    <svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="24" height="24" fill="currentColor" viewBox="0 0 256 256"><path d="M221.66,133.66l-72,72a8,8,0,0,1-11.32-11.32L196.69,136H40a8,8,0,0,1,0-16H196.69L138.34,61.66a8,8,0,0,1,11.32-11.32l72,72A8,8,0,0,1,221.66,133.66Z"></path></svg>
                </a>
            </div>

            <div class="solution-media">
                <Image src={solutionImage} alt="Shopify para sua loja" data-i18n-attr="alt:solution.imageAlt" />
            </div>
        </div>

        <div class="solution-highlights">
            <div class="solution-highlights-grid">
                <article class="solution-highlight-card">
                    <div class="solution-highlight-head">
                        <div class="solution-highlight-iconbox" aria-hidden="true">
                            <svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="24" height="24" fill="currentColor" viewBox="0 0 256 256"><path d="M240,192h-8V56a16,16,0,0,0-16-16H40A16,16,0,0,0,24,56V192H16a8,8,0,0,0,0,16H240a8,8,0,0,0,0-16ZM40,56H216V192H200V168a8,8,0,0,0-8-8H120a8,8,0,0,0-8,8v24H72V88H184v48a8,8,0,0,0,16,0V80a8,8,0,0,0-8-8H64a8,8,0,0,0-8,8V192H40ZM184,192H128V176h56Z"></path></svg>
                        </div>
                        <h3 class="solution-highlight-title" data-i18n="solution.highlights.card1.title">Facilidade e diversos recursos</h3>
                    </div>
                    <p class="solution-highlight-text" data-i18n="solution.highlights.card1.text">Interface fácil de usar, sem precisar de equipe técnica, e com diversos apps na Shopify App Store para personalizar sua loja como quiser.</p>
                </article>

                <article class="solution-highlight-card">
                    <div class="solution-highlight-head">
                        <div class="solution-highlight-iconbox" aria-hidden="true">
                            <svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="24" height="24" fill="currentColor" viewBox="0 0 256 256"><path d="M120,136V96a8,8,0,0,1,16,0v40a8,8,0,0,1-16,0Zm8,48a12,12,0,1,0-12-12A12,12,0,0,0,128,184ZM224,56v56c0,52.72-25.52,84.67-46.93,102.19-23.06,18.86-46,25.27-47,25.53a8,8,0,0,1-4.2,0c-1-.26-23.91-6.67-47-25.53C57.52,196.67,32,164.72,32,112V56A16,16,0,0,1,48,40H208A16,16,0,0,1,224,56Zm-16,0L48,56l0,56c0,37.3,13.82,67.51,41.07,89.81A128.25,128.25,0,0,0,128,223.62a129.3,129.3,0,0,0,39.41-22.2C194.34,179.16,208,149.07,208,112Z"></path></svg>
                        </div>
                        <h3 class="solution-highlight-title" data-i18n="solution.highlights.card2.title">Segurança e escalabilidade</h3>
                    </div>
                    <p class="solution-highlight-text" data-i18n="solution.highlights.card2.text">Segura e escalável: com SSL e PCI DSS, a Shopify protege dados e cresce com seu negócio, de startups a grandes empresas.</p>
                </article>

                <article class="solution-highlight-card">
                    <div class="solution-highlight-head">
                        <div class="solution-highlight-iconbox" aria-hidden="true">
                            <svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="24" height="24" fill="currentColor" viewBox="0 0 256 256"><path d="M232,96a7.89,7.89,0,0,0-.3-2.2L217.35,43.6A16.07,16.07,0,0,0,202,32H54A16.07,16.07,0,0,0,38.65,43.6L24.31,93.8A7.89,7.89,0,0,0,24,96h0v16a40,40,0,0,0,16,32v72a8,8,0,0,0,8,8H208a8,8,0,0,0,8-8V144a40,40,0,0,0,16-32V96ZM54,48H202l11.42,40H42.61Zm50,56h48v8a24,24,0,0,1-48,0Zm-16,0v8a24,24,0,0,1-35.12,21.26,7.88,7.88,0,0,0-1.82-1.06A24,24,0,0,1,40,112v-8ZM200,208H56V151.2a40.57,40.57,0,0,0,8,.8,40,40,0,0,0,32-16,40,40,0,0,0,64,0,40,40,0,0,0,32,16,40.57,40.57,0,0,0,8-.8Zm4.93-75.8a8.08,8.08,0,0,0-1.8,1.05A24,24,0,0,1,168,112v-8h48v8A24,24,0,0,1,204.93,132.2Z"></path></svg>
                        </div>
                        <h3 class="solution-highlight-title" data-i18n="solution.highlights.card3.title">Loja de aplicativos completa</h3>
                    </div>
                    <p class="solution-highlight-text" data-i18n="solution.highlights.card3.text">Conecte sua loja a redes sociais, canais de venda, marketing, e até plataformas de frete com facilidade. Tudo em um só lugar.</p>
                </article>

                <article class="solution-highlight-card">
                    <div class="solution-highlight-head">
                        <div class="solution-highlight-iconbox" aria-hidden="true">
                            <svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="24" height="24" fill="currentColor" viewBox="0 0 256 256"><path d="M232.07,186.76a80,80,0,0,0-62.5-114.17A80,80,0,1,0,23.93,138.76l-7.27,24.71a16,16,0,0,0,19.87,19.87l24.71-7.27a80.39,80.39,0,0,0,25.18,7.35,80,80,0,0,0,108.34,40.65l24.71,7.27a16,16,0,0,0,19.87-19.86ZM62,159.5a8.28,8.28,0,0,0-2.26.32L32,168l8.17-27.76a8,8,0,0,0-.63-6,64,64,0,1,1,26.26,26.26A8,8,0,0,0,62,159.5Zm153.79,28.73L224,216l-27.76-8.17a8,8,0,0,0-6,.63,64.05,64.05,0,0,1-85.87-24.88A79.93,79.93,0,0,0,174.7,89.71a64,64,0,0,1,41.75,92.48A8,8,0,0,0,215.82,188.23Z"></path></svg>
                        </div>
                        <h3 class="solution-highlight-title" data-i18n="solution.highlights.card4.title">Equipe de suporte 24/7</h3>
                    </div>
                    <p class="solution-highlight-text" data-i18n="solution.highlights.card4.text">Assistência contínua para manter sua loja online, com suporte de conta rápido e direto, sem filas, espera ou abertura de tickets.</p>
                </article>
            </div>
        </div>

        <div class="section-divider" aria-hidden="true"></div>
    </section>